dustrial-grade 200W power supply. Wide voltage range for UAE installations.</strong></p><p>The Industrial-grade LED Power Supply Unit 200W offers a wide input voltage range of 110-240V AC and high efficiency of 93%, making it perfect for stable power delivery to indoor LED displays and modules across UAE installations. Featuring multiple DC outputs, it provides flexible connectivity and supports reliable, energy-efficient operation critical for demanding indoor environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What input voltage range does the LED Power Supply Unit 200W support?</h3><p>This power supply supports a wide input voltage range from 110V to 240V AC, making it ideal for installations across the UAE and other GCC countries.</p><h3>Is the power supply compatible with indoor LED modules only?</h3><p>Yes, this 200W power supply unit is designed primarily for indoor LED displays and modules, providing stable and efficient power delivery.</p><h3>What is the efficiency rating of this power supply, and why does it matter?</h3><p>The LED Power Supply Unit 200W has an efficiency of 93%, which ensures minimal energy loss, reduced heat generation, and lower operating costs.</p><h3>How does this 200W power supply compare to alternatives with lower wattages?</h3><p>Compared to lower wattage units, this 200W power supply can support larger or multiple LED modules simultaneously while maintaining consistent performance and reliability.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"LED Power Supply Unit 200W – Reliable LED Power Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Get the 200W LED Power Supply Unit for stable LED screen performance in Dubai. Buy from Brightluxx, your trusted UAE LED partner!\"}],[\"$\",\"lin